{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1000_p", "source_sha256": "113e92ea29202fb5bff568ae002ef118679c3219e6329196651ae1d2fd75e60f", "ja": "（美希プロデュースのアパレル発売に向けて、\n今日はカタログ用の写真撮影。前半が順調に終わった）", "zh": "（为了发售美希制作人系列的服装，今天拍摄了目录用的照片。前半部分顺利结束了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "a9a40d23158ad2fead47efb5d91bbeb62b6a383e23dacade30411a5085676b8c", "ja": "お疲れ様なの、{$P$}。\nちゃんと見てくれてた？", "zh": "辛苦啦，{$P$}先生。你有好好看着吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bb0ca8a37f325e93514276d75f31a8cfec17ea224c2c777c5c572d6004fa046f", "ja": "もちろん。バッチリだったぞ。\nカメラマンさんも「いい写真が撮れた」って。", "zh": "当然，表现得非常棒。\n摄影师也说“拍到了很好的照片”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "9c3ae5c7caa99f287409307adc1d82776e64bb79032e131032f7da365f53096b", "ja": "あはっ、ありがとうなの☆　まあ、ミキが考えた\nコーデだし、トーゼンってカンジだけどね♪", "zh": "啊哈，谢谢你哦☆　不过，毕竟是美希想的\n穿搭，这也是理所当然的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "523b127169aa15a25ff244e9cf692219640ce53044f906616ce9c121cb6198b5", "ja": "今日のミキは、\nちょっぴりオトナでカッコいい感じに決めてみたの。", "zh": "今天的美希，试着打扮得稍微成熟又帅气一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "8d71028d7cc609d096f6eb91f86a28cf66f6d998862903cb9e903a42716aea4b", "ja": "見た人が、ドキッとしてくれたらいいなって。\n{$P$}はどうだった？", "zh": "要是看的人能心跳加速就好了。\n{$P$}觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b7264ba66c51bd3339f313a44e021ab18390362947e1881281eb7d21688b76d3", "ja": "まさか、そんな風なテーマがあったとは……。\n美希の狙い通り、ドキッとしたよ。", "zh": "没想到，居然还有这样的主题……。\n正如美希所期待的那样，我心动了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "41f073e513e457b53ace6ded5dc36c71b757e52adcaa3808305831929d51c999", "ja": "やったーなの♪　{$P$}も、この\nコーデ気に入ってくれたみたいだし、大満足なの！", "zh": "太好啦～♪　看起来{$P$}也很中意这套\n穿搭，美希超级满足的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1008_p", "source_sha256": "95916745d6bdb83156c4d957975323bf40ccce86340541544f3d2152ffcd2bf2", "ja": "気に入ってるかはノーコメントとして、\n確かに大満足な出来だ。", "zh": "至于喜不喜欢，我就不评论了，不过确实完成得令人非常满意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1009_p", "source_sha256": "db1b918d339a028d55392513b060227ce1ab04508a266872ebb7a65fbc35ae08", "ja": "ファンの人達も、美希の服を喜んでくれると思うよ。\n告知した時も、SNSで大騒ぎだったし。", "zh": "我想粉丝们也会喜欢美希的服装。\n之前公布消息时，社交平台上也引起了不小的轰动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "c5750ba48acb6ac8bbf8e91440142e1c6195c5e06d1512cec9fe31ee36572c39", "ja": "うん！　ミキも楽しみなの♪　街中にミキのコーデで\nカワイくなった女の子がいっぱい……。", "zh": "嗯！美希也很期待呢♪　到时候街上到处都是穿着美希搭配、变得可爱的女孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "8e727ea023151a1dc7b0e802276e911b9005fdc4fd05c20078b51d26b5b85d03", "ja": "……はっ！　だ、ダメなの！\nそうなったら、大変なことになっちゃう……。", "zh": "……哈！不、不行呀！\n要是变成那样，可就大事不妙了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9b52246a7bc999ef09a75aa159ca6fa4955bff98a53cfcf78e36d27d4c49e859", "ja": "美希……？", "zh": "美希……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "5e24a232e6a84cab4d21431039569a72d10a851ebbe4b961dc8b10f836d4db44", "ja": "ミキとおんなじ格好した、カワイイ子が増えたら……\nハニーが、ミキを見てくれなくなるの～！", "zh": "要是打扮得和美希一模一样的可爱孩子变多了……\n亲爱的就不会看美希了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1014_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "216d5e74feb7d174923ecc81cf820b53b59bf3943fa4408fb7c2b88fe9c0cf3a", "ja": "だって、このコーデお気に入りなんでしょ？\n他の子が着たら……ミキ、大大大ピンチなの！", "zh": "因为这套服装是你最喜欢的，对吧？\n要是被其他人穿了……美希可就大大大危机了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1016_p", "source_sha256": "dda108ed9ec032748d98e6ff0b3883930dd354b7283771020d3bcd3d78423561", "ja": "えーっと……美希がピンチなのはわかった。\nでもな。俺は、服だけ褒めたわけじゃない。", "zh": "呃……我明白了，美希遇到大危机了。\n不过啊，我可不是只夸了衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1017_p", "source_sha256": "11826c148e22e7404a759861a1810a29680f84de044b37f1be5686c48b488d9a", "ja": "しっかり着こなしてる美希を含めて、褒めたんだ。\n心配しなくても、美希を見なくなることは無いよ。", "zh": "我是连把这身衣服穿得很合适的美希在内，一起夸奖的。你不用担心，我不会不再看美希的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "2665a31fc77d7995a4f8e2b20fe9b44f15fbefe022a498b099b9fc0f0b13f225", "ja": "ハニー……。", "zh": "亲爱的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "9b9cb9c49ce1ee2026b1c8ef9c0bd6a576f4fc6044e07e5370eb01e1595b7f77", "ja": "じゃあ、ミキと同じ服を着た子とすれ違っても\nチラッて、見ちゃったりしない？", "zh": "那么，就算和穿着跟美希一样衣服的女孩子擦肩而过，也不会忍不住瞄一眼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f05428e23b55ec8455269d564516ad64b3b75bc10c845377c29ee28d16039aea", "ja": "そうだな……。美希の服を買ってくれた人だから、\n思わず見るかも……？", "zh": "是啊……毕竟是买了美希那身衣服的人，可能会不由自主地看一眼……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "7c93303f94672883b985259fab51c06fefbf4924c10034561a86474e459f75da", "ja": "うう、ハニーのウソつき～！\nミキだけって言ったのに……。", "zh": "呜呜，Honey大骗子～！\n明明说了只看美希一个人的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "b263f53df7e5293c5deb1a2c6825650afafa7cdf02f674941f34602956f16922", "ja": "こうなったら、ミキもホンキ出すの！　ハニーが\nよそ見しないように、コーデもアレンジして……。", "zh": "既然这样，美希也要认真起来！为了不让亲爱的东张西望，还要重新搭配造型……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0434_1023_p", "source_sha256": "8d2175325d4d55a4baa24a86e704f60a88f31af0c2be036451d3453459c5f26f", "ja": "わ、わかった！　一旦落ち着いてくれ、美希！\nアレンジするのは撮影のあとにしてくれ～！", "zh": "我、我知道了！先冷静一下，美希！\n改搭配的事等拍完之后再说吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
